@startuml
title Aveli — Database Knowledge Map

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
  FontColor black
  RoundCorner 8
}
skinparam ArrowColor black

top to bottom direction

rectangle "Data Architecture\nOwnership / Lifecycle" as Architecture
rectangle "Conceptual Model\nSystem meaning" as Conceptual
rectangle "Logical Model\nAttributes / Relations / Cardinality" as Logical

rectangle "Local Persistence\nPer-user workspace" as Local
rectangle "Server Persistence\nIdentity / Access / Billing" as Server

rectangle "SQLite + Files\nPhysical local data" as LocalPhysical
rectangle "PostgreSQL\nPhysical server data" as ServerPhysical

rectangle "Drift\nLocal data-access layer" as Drift
rectangle "Prisma\nServer data-access layer" as Prisma

Architecture --> Conceptual
Conceptual --> Logical

Logical --> Local
Logical --> Server

Local --> LocalPhysical
Server --> ServerPhysical

LocalPhysical --> Drift : accessed through
ServerPhysical --> Prisma : accessed through

note bottom of Architecture
Defines responsibility before storage detail.
end note

note bottom of Logical
Technology-independent structure.
end note

note bottom of Local
Professional workspace data
is not synchronized to backend.
end note

note bottom of Server
Backend owns account,
access and subscription state.
end note

@enduml
